WEBVTT

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:10.200
Hi, and welcome to Urban Worm Ranching. I'm Alix, and I have over 20 years of experience in horticulture and ecology.

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:16.250
I'll be guiding you through this brief introduction to vermiculture—or, as I prefer to call it, worm ranching.

00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:24.380
If you've never thought about keeping worms before, you might be wondering, "Where exactly am I supposed to put a worm bin?"

00:00:24.920 --> 00:00:31.820
That's a perfectly reasonable question, especially if you live in an apartment or have limited space.

00:00:33.030 --> 00:00:40.500
The good news is that worm ranching doesn't require a backyard, a huge compost pile, or a lot of specialized equipment.

00:00:40.930 --> 00:00:49.710
We'll look at how a worm bin works, what you'll need to get started, and some common problems you might encounter.

00:00:50.950 --> 00:00:59.010
Later, you'll work through a scenario where you'll help a new worm rancher make decisions about her bin

00:00:59.420 --> 00:01:04.020
and see how those choices affect the system.

00:01:04.400 --> 00:01:10.290
So let's get started and see whether worm ranching might work for you.
